  "summary_md": "**Rezaul Hoque Turjo ([@TurjoAt](https://x.com/TurjoAt/status/2115886451254784267))** releases **AgentNeuron v1.1**, a free local control center for Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and Copilot: live view of files each agent edits with collision warnings, a ship check that runs tests and builds for an evidence-based verdict, risky-change review, cost per session with replay, checks for CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/MCP configs, and handoff briefs; no account, telemetry or model calls (`npx agentneuron`) ([TurjoAt/agentneuron](https://github.com/TurjoAt/agentneuron)).",
